# EtFooter - Agent Guide

> **AI Assistant Documentation**: This guide helps AI coding assistants understand and work with the EtFooter component.

## Overview

The `EtFooter` component is a flexible, compound component for building page footers in the eToro React Native application. It provides a consistent layout for disclaimers, buttons, checkboxes, pagination, and navigation links.

## Key Architecture

- **Compound Component Pattern**: `EtFooter.Section`, `EtFooter.Scrollable`, `EtFooter.Link`
- **Section-Based Layout**: Children are stacked vertically with consistent spacing
- **Scrollable Support**: Vertical scrolling for tall content or horizontal pagination with dots
- **Theme Integration**: Uses `useEtoroTheme` for background color and link styling

